('PiatetskiShapiroShafarevich1971','https://www.mathnet.ru/php/getFT.phtml?jrnid=im&option_lang=eng&paperid=2021&what=fullteng','Original English translation: section3 Corollary3 p.560 (PDFp.14); section6 Theorem1(3) pp.573-574 (PDFpp.27-28) and following corollary p.574','cdp:st:C.2.UN.24','Opened the nonzero square-zero algebraic-class criterion for an elliptic pencil, its Riemann-Roch and basepoint-free construction, and the terminating reflection algorithm into the nef cone. The projective K3 hypothesis matches the branch where the paper applies this result.'),

