('HuybrechtsK3Draft','https://www.math.uni-bonn.de/people/huybrech/K3Global.pdf','Author final prepublication draft: Chapter1 Example1.3(iii) pp.8-9; Definition3.1 and Example3.3 p.14','cdp:st:C.2.UN.13;cdp:st:C.2.UN.24','Opened the sixteen fixed-point quotient, its blowup double-cover comparison, canonical-bundle and coherent-trace proofs, and the explicit extension from abelian surfaces to arbitrary complex two-tori. The author identifies this as a prepublication draft; no claim of publisher-edition pagination is made.'),
